(1. Building description) Tj T*
(Two-storey school for 220 pupils and 26 staff. Gross area 2 480 m2.) Tj T*
(Construction is steel frame with concrete floors. Building class 2.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Escape) Tj T*
(Two protected stair cores, north and south, each discharging directly) Tj T*
(to open air. Maximum travel distance to a protected route is 28 m) Tj T*
(against a permitted 35 m. Classroom doors open in the direction of) Tj T*
(escape. Final exit widths total 4.8 m against a required 3.6 m.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Compartmentation) Tj T*
(Stair cores are EI60. Classrooms are separated from the corridor at) Tj T*
(EI30. The plant room and refuse store are EI60. The kitchen is EI30) Tj T*
(with an EI30 shutter to the servery.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Detection and alarm) Tj T*
(Category L1 automatic detection throughout, with sounders achieving 65) Tj T*
(dB\(A\) at the bedhead equivalent position in all occupied rooms. Manual) Tj T*
(call points at each final exit and at each stair core on each level.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Fire service access) Tj T*
(A hardstanding within 18 m of the north entrance accommodates a) Tj T*
(pumping appliance. A dry riser is not required at this height.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Outstanding items) Tj T*
(Confirmation of the smoke ventilation opening area to the south stair) Tj T*
